  "1ebc1b7b-a675-414e-a74c-d16afac6aacc"],
 ". ",
 StyleBox["xCPS",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " includes several rules that will be detailed in the following Sections. \
The user can generate their own rules by defining variational vector fields \
as we will see on Chapter",
 StyleBox[" ",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 0.]],
 StyleBox[
 CounterBox["Chapter", 
  "Chapter Variational vectors and Variational vector fields"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 "."
}], "Text",
