Cell["\<\
As for any other frozen metric, it is essential to understand that \
raising/lowering indices is done with the main metric, not the frozen one.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9524363958877215`*^9, 3.952436400634348*^9}, {
