Cell["\<\
The Lie bracket of two vector fields of a finite-dimensional vector space can \
be written in coordinates as follows:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.957195624572996*^9, 3.957195625996582*^9}, {
  3.957195806967476*^9, 3.957195811061472*^9}, {3.9572031137249184`*^9, 
