 "Ricci"], "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->
  "2dd907d2-6452-074e-b84d-10cf8f438ae7"],
 " is constant. Since both are constant, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "alpha0"], "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->
  "4cb0e758-21e9-e048-afae-b26bd28fe993"],
