Cell["\<\
We have some \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]question \
functions\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] to identify those types of terms:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9533898085400696`*^9, 3.953389914341772*^9}, {
  3.953390160465475*^9, 3.9533901679825096`*^9}, {3.957211477065668*^9, 
