  0., 0., 0.],ExpressionUUID->"2196f0ea-bf60-6e44-9a3c-dbdf4b15580e"],

Cell["\<\
If the only variable field is \[Phi] (thus \[DifferentialD]g=0), we clearly \
obtain (upon integration over a Cauchy slice) the canonical symplectic \
structure (position times momenta):\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.950558921339657*^9, 3.950559000453705*^9}, 
   3.950965496114532*^9, {3.950978949224764*^9, 3.950978953849434*^9}, {
