Cell[TextData[{
 "In this Chapter, we are going to present several ways to study the \
Covariant Phase Space formalism of electromagnetism (EM). In Section ",
 StyleBox[
 CounterBox["Chapter", "Section Electr 1 Way"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 StyleBox[ButtonBox[".",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->"Section Electr 1 Way"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 StyleBox[
 CounterBox["Section", "Section Electr 1 Way"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 ", we present a straightforward approach to study the EM i.e., using ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "A"], "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"71c45cae-099a-4c40-82cc-5b1b098527cd"],
 " as variable and not using the fact that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"F", "=", "dA"}]], "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->
  "cb76dc2e-a517-a047-ba0e-918b19eaaf07"],
 ". In Section ",
 StyleBox[
 CounterBox["Chapter", "Section Electr 2 Way"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 StyleBox[ButtonBox[".",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->"Section Electr 2 Way"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 StyleBox[
 CounterBox["Section", "Section Electr 2 Way"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 ", we present another quick approach by using ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "F"], "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"c1601eab-95b0-3842-87b0-156030a99b38"],
 " as variable and then using rules to transform F and \[DifferentialD]F. On \
Section ",
 StyleBox[
 CounterBox["Chapter", "Section Electr 3 Way"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 StyleBox[ButtonBox[".",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->"Section Electr 3 Way"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 StyleBox[
 CounterBox["Section", "Section Electr 3 Way"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 ", we will consider a more subtle approach in which we use a rule to \
transform ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "F"}]], "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->
  "53dfc636-466b-534e-98f8-318ce12fc9ee"],
 " but not ",
 Cell[BoxData[
 "F"], "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"23d66f8f-37ef-814c-ba16-876cd4874da7"],
 ". We will see that this offers some advantages but also some disadvantages. \
Finally, on Section ",
 StyleBox[
 CounterBox["Chapter", "Section Electr 4 Way"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 StyleBox[ButtonBox[".",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->"Section Electr 4 Way"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 StyleBox[
 CounterBox["Section", "Section Electr 4 Way"],
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 StyleBox[", ",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]],
 "we offer the best approach that takes full advantage of the power of ",
 StyleBox["xCPS",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ".\n\nAll functions and options have been defined in the previous chapters \
so no further explanations are provided in this or the following chapters. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.951859620914671*^9, 3.9518596275670185`*^9}, {
   3.954519843593357*^9, 3.9545198623567142`*^9}, 3.9553907302534904`*^9, {
   3.9575451071496964`*^9, 3.9575452673388157`*^9}, {3.957546309017748*^9, 
