  RowBox[{"'", 
   RowBox[{"vvf1", "'"}]}]], "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->
  "0b68a661-628f-d348-92c8-be6610907ec9"],
 " is not only a symmetry, but it is also a gauge transformation i.e., a \
transformation that, when restricted to the space of solutions (on-shell) has \
",
